    "created_at": "2016-09-21T18:38:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-21T18:38:49Z",
    "body": "Because the the EcmaScript spec:\nhttps://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-ordinaryget\n\nI would expect the current HTML specification to result in us returning undefined when accessing location.href, instead of throwing an exception. This is because OrdinaryGet calls [[GetOwnProperty]] which returns a descriptor that is not undefined but desc.get is undefined.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/248703433/reactions",
