    "created_at": "2016-09-26T09:06:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T09:06:42Z",
    "body": "The reason [[Get]] throws by the way is because https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#crossoriginget-(-o,-p,-receiver-) says to do so.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
